            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Synthetic biology has developed quickly over the past decade. To review the research progress in synthetic biology, we published this special issue that consists of three columns, namely scientific significance, technological advances, and applications in medical science, pharmaceutics, agriculture, material, environment and energy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
